{"path":"string/wide/wmemset","title":"std::wmemset","titleHtml":"<span class=\"t-title-prefix\">std::</span>wmemset","originalUrl":"https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/string/wide/wmemset","section":"string","kind":"page","summary":"Copies the wide character ch into each of the first count wide characters of the wide character array pointed to by dest.","html":"<table class=\"t-dcl-begin\"><tbody>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc-header\">\n<td> <div>Defined in header <code><a href=\"/w/cpp/header/cwchar\">&lt;cwchar&gt;</a></code>\n </div></td>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl\">\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\"> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw4\">wchar_t</span><span class=\"sy2\">*</span> wmemset<span class=\"br0\">(</span> <span class=\"kw4\">wchar_t</span><span class=\"sy2\">*</span> dest, <span class=\"kw4\">wchar_t</span> ch, <a href=\"/w/cpp/types/size_t\"><span class=\"kw107\">std::<span class=\"me2\">size_t</span></span></a> count <span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\">  </td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\">  </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl-sep\"><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Copies the wide character <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">ch</span></code> into each of the first <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">count</span></code> wide characters of the wide character array pointed to by <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">dest</span></code>.\n</p><p>If overflow occurs, the behavior is undefined.\n</p><p>If <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">count</span></code> is zero, the function does nothing.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Parameters\">Parameters</h3>\n<table class=\"t-par-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-par\">\n<td> dest\n</td>\n<td> -\n</td>\n<td> pointer to the wide character array to fill\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-par\">\n<td> ch\n</td>\n<td> -\n</td>\n<td> fill wide character\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-par\">\n<td> count\n</td>\n<td> -\n</td>\n<td> number of wide characters to fill\n</td></tr></table>\n<h3 id=\"Return_value\">Return value</h3>\n<p>Returns a copy of <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">dest</span></code>.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Notes\">Notes</h3>\n<p>This function is not locale-sensitive and pays no attention to the values of the <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw4\">wchar_t</span></span></code> objects it writes: nulls as well as invalid wide characters are written too.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Example\">Example</h3>\n<div class=\"t-example\">\n<pre data-lang=\"cpp\"><code><span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;clocale&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;cwchar&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;iostream&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;locale&gt;</span>\n&nbsp;\n<span class=\"kw4\">int</span> main<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n    <span class=\"kw4\">wchar_t</span> ar<span class=\"br0\">[</span><span class=\"nu0\">4</span><span class=\"br0\">]</span> <span class=\"sy1\">=</span> <span class=\"br0\">{</span>L<span class=\"st0\">'1'</span>, L<span class=\"st0\">'2'</span>, L<span class=\"st0\">'3'</span>, L<span class=\"st0\">'4'</span><span class=\"br0\">}</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    std<span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">wmemset</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span>ar, L<span class=\"st0\">'<span class=\"es4\">\\U0001f34c</span>'</span>, <span class=\"nu0\">2</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span> <span class=\"co1\">// replaces [12] with the 🍌 bananas</span>\n    std<span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">wmemset</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span>ar <span class=\"sy2\">+</span> <span class=\"nu0\">2</span>, L<span class=\"st0\">'蕉'</span>, <span class=\"nu0\">2</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span> <span class=\"co1\">// replaces [34] with the 蕉 bananas</span>\n&nbsp;\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/locale/setlocale\"><span class=\"kw2006\">std::<span class=\"me2\">setlocale</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span><a href=\"/w/cpp/locale/LC_categories\"><span class=\"kw2009\">LC_ALL</span></a>, <span class=\"st0\">\"en_US.utf8\"</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1775\">std::<span class=\"me2\">wcout</span></span></a>.<span class=\"me1\">imbue</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><a href=\"/w/cpp/locale/locale\"><span class=\"kw1910\">std::<span class=\"me2\">locale</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"st0\">\"en_US.utf8\"</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1775\">std::<span class=\"me2\">wcout</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/string/basic_string\"><span class=\"kw1239\">std::<span class=\"me2\">wstring</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span>ar, <span class=\"nu0\">4</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">'<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>'</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">}</span></code></pre>\n<p>Possible output:\n</p>\n<pre data-output=\"1\"><code>🍌🍌蕉蕉</code></pre> \n</div>\n<h3 id=\"See_also\">See also</h3>\n<table class=\"t-dsc-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/string/byte/memset\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>memset</span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  fills a buffer with a character <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(function)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/string/wide/wmemcpy\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>wmemcpy</span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  copies a certain amount of wide characters between two non-overlapping arrays <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(function)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/algorithm/fill_n\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>fill_n</span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  copy-assigns the given value to N elements in a range <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(function template)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td colspan=\"2\"> <div class=\"t-dsc-see\"><span><a href=\"/w/c/string/wide/wmemset\">C documentation</a></span> for <span class=\"t-dsc-see-tt\"><span>wmemset</span></span></div>\n</td></tr>\n</table>","headings":[{"depth":3,"text":"Parameters","id":"Parameters"},{"depth":3,"text":"Return value","id":"Return_value"},{"depth":3,"text":"Notes","id":"Notes"},{"depth":3,"text":"Example","id":"Example"},{"depth":3,"text":"See also","id":"See_also"}],"breadcrumbs":[{"path":"","title":"C++ reference"},{"path":"string","title":"Strings library"},{"path":"string/wide","title":"Null-terminated wide strings"}],"children":[],"map":{"label":"std::wmemset","children":[{"label":"Declarations","note":"1 declaration. Copies the wide character ch into each of the first count wide characters of the wide character array pointed to by…"},{"label":"Parameters","note":"dest, ch, count"},{"label":"Return value","note":"Returns a copy of dest."},{"label":"Notes","note":"This function is not locale-sensitive and pays no attention to the values of the wchar_t objects it writes: nulls as well as invalid wide characters are…"},{"label":"Example"},{"label":"See also","children":[{"label":"memset","note":"fills a buffer with a character"},{"label":"wmemcpy","note":"copies a certain amount of wide characters between two non-overlapping arrays"},{"label":"fill_n","note":"copy-assigns the given value to N elements in a range"}]}]},"standards":[],"wordCount":204,"codeBlockCount":2}
